# SLAM25 Members Area - Project Structure

## Architecture Overview

This is a full-stack Poetry Slam application with a React 19 frontend and Express.js backend using PostgreSQL.

### Core Architecture
- **Frontend**: React 19 + Vite + TailwindCSS + React Router v7
- **Backend**: Express.js + PostgreSQL + Raw SQL
- **Real-time**: Socket.io for WebSocket connections
- **PWA**: Progressive Web App with service workers

## Key Entry Points
- **Frontend**: [index.html](mdc:index.html) → [client/main.jsx](mdc:client/main.jsx) → [client/App.jsx](mdc:client/App.jsx)
- **Backend**: [server/server.js](mdc:server/server.js)
- **Database Schema**: [database/schema.sql](mdc:database/schema.sql)

